-- plants-seed.sql — Bloom plant catalogue (1,000 species, Pl@ntNet-300K subset)
-- Generated from bloom-plant-dataset.csv (2026-11-12).
-- common_name is the scientific name here: the CSV has no common names.
-- plantHelpers.js backfills the real common name the first time
-- Pl@ntNet identifies one of these species (see README).
-- Safe to run twice: ON CONFLICT (scientific_name) DO NOTHING.
-- 2 species appear twice in the CSV (Ophrys fusca, Ophrys sphegodes),
-- so 998 distinct rows are inserted.

